step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test a single best model to see if it outperforms the robust combination baselines.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"CWT_rf"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination over a smaller, stable pool (pool1) to see if it beats the current best single model.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a robust median over pool2 to see if a different subset improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a robust median over the largest consistent pool (pool3) to see if it beats the single best model.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Test a robust DBA combination on the most consistent pool (pool3) to see if it outperforms the best single or trimmed mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool3","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a trimmed_mean over the full pool to see if a broader robust mean improves over the current best single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a DBA combination on the smallest pool (pool1) to see if a more focused robust aggregation improves over the best single and trimmed mean results.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test the untried dba on pool2 to see if it improves over the best single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a different best_single model to see if a single strong model beats the current leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ONLY_CWT_rf"}

Thought: Test the best single model CWT_catboost to see if it beats CWT_rf.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"CWT_catboost"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse-error weights on the most stable pool (pool3) to see if it beats the best single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool3","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on a carefully selected subset of the most reliable models from pool3 to see if a smaller, high‑quality pool improves over the full‑pool weighted baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["CWT_rf","FT_rf","CWT_catboost","ARIMA","ETS"],"weights":"inverse_error"}

